From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:33:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] BlueOS: Launcher3: BlueOS home screen by default

- The 4x5 grid until the user picks one: near-square cells where
  two-column widgets fill a row symmetrically.
- Themed ("Minimalism") icons until the user picks a style.
- Default 4x5 home screen: summary + Arona sticker (photo widget, asked
  for through the default-workspace extra), clock card + music, date +
  equalizer, quick toggles, then Play Store, Files, Music, Settings; the
  dock with Phone, Messages, Contacts, Camera.

Change-Id: Id9b0f6a3dc18a4dfd8f13d8f1e529b1a595df274
